    "updated_at": "2020-11-14T12:33:24Z",
    "body": "The default starship configuration requires a Nerd Font. The nerd font project doesn't appear to provide a pre-patched Monaco font, but it provides [a patcher](https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts#font-patcher) you could use to patch your font. Can you check if it works correctly if you use a nerd font?\r\nI'm not sure either why disabling the line break module would cause this change though.",
